  "_doc": "The multimodal baseline classes. Paths are relative to the corpus directory (the fixture repository's corpus/ tree: images/<set>/<name>, videos/<set>/<name>, audios/<set>/<name>). A class with a `synthetic` recipe is materialized from its `from` file by the entry point when the corpus has no public file of that shape yet; its provenance stays the source file's. `processor` names the model family whose preprocessing the class runs through; `config` names the directory holding that checkpoint's config.json and preprocessor configs (given to the entry point as --config-dir <name>=<dir>).",
